\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Final Reminder\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 These are self-reported, non-clinical reflective signals \'97 not diagnoses, not facts about who you are, and not evidence of past behavior. Treat every score as a prompt for curiosity rather than a verdict. If any of your own reflection surfaces something that looks like a specific incident involving bullying, harassment, discrimination, or serious misconduct \'97 yours or someone else's \'97 that's a matter for your organization's formal HR or ethics channels, not a self-directed fix. And please don't share your specific scores, your study code, or this interpretation with colleagues or in performance contexts \'97 this tool is designed for private, voluntary reflection only, and that privacy protects both you and the integrity of your data in any related study.\
